# Licensing

The contents of this repo derive from several upstream projects under different
licenses, so they are listed separately.

| File | License | Why |
|---|---|---|
| `patches/linux-*.patch` | GPL-2.0-only | they are diffs against the Linux kernel |
| `config/v821_rv32_defconfig`, `config/config-diff.txt` | GPL-2.0-only | kernel configuration |
| `patches/opensbi-01-v821-a27-port.patch` | BSD-2-Clause | it is a diff against OpenSBI, which is BSD-2-Clause |
| `boot/v821-min.dts` | GPL-2.0-only OR MIT | following the convention for device trees in the kernel |
| `boot/a27_stub.S`, `initramfs/init.sh` | GPL-2.0-only | written for this project |
| `build.sh`, `scripts/*`, `Makefile` | GPL-2.0-only | written for this project |
| `initramfs/prebuilt/busybox` | GPL-2.0-only | a build of BusyBox 1.33.2; source at https://busybox.net/ , configuration in `config/busybox-rv32.config` |

Full license texts:
- GPL-2.0-only — https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt
- BSD-2-Clause — https://opensource.org/license/bsd-2-clause

`initramfs/prebuilt/busybox` is the binary form of a GPL program, and GPL-2.0 section 3
requires the corresponding source to be available. The version is BusyBox 1.33.2 (the
upstream tarball), the build configuration is this repo's `config/busybox-rv32.config`,
and the build command is in `initramfs/prebuilt/README.md`.
